n": "The campaign achieved 9,30% engagement rate overall, signalling active content consumption rather than passive viewing. Audiences recorded 2,063 saves across 67 videos, averaging ~31 saves per video. Save behaviour indicates parents found the content informative and worth revisiting", "creatorTiersDescription": "", "audienceSentimentDescription": "Brand intrigue amongst consumers is high, many want to know more about the product and services. What intrigues them the most is *special feature the company has*. ", "platformBreakdownDescription": "Instagram was chosen as the platform of focus because: <br><div>- it aligned with client branding</div><div>- Audiences were older </div><div>- More creators of that niche were on Instagram  </div><div><br></div><div>As videos for this campaign performed very well, this indicates that choosing Instagram was the correct choice.</div>", "noteworthyCreatorsDescription": "", "bestPerformingPersonasDescription": "We wanted to to focus on creating organic and soft sell content through utilising popular content styles on Instagram "}	2026-02-24 07:05:18.801	2026-07-13 00:07:30.097	1
