rMTQySw5fg%2FkHRctGMvuJq3iIfU8TgpaJz32VmyNHWa2kZRUn%2Bwg%2F0cMb9uaEXt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C78eAFip8_g/", "description": "Surprising my family with matching outfits for Father’s Day! \\n\\nI got these amazing polos from @kualesa.apparel! Check their Father’s Day sale with up to 30% on selected pieces 😍"}, {"like": 110, "comment": 9, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcZHoyIXjA9rUde8FI66oU7nHrIlCi19rVV%2BFm8ZAG3nN09UCwUY6zHNlI6KbO961fXt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9KBzKapfMo/", "description": "@cultworkspace is really changing the game for creators and brands.\\n\\nWe’ve secured over 100 local and international brand deals, paying out more than RM400,000 to 1500 creators in 2024 alone. Those numbers are only part of our story though.\\n\\nWhat sets us apart is how we turn customers into brand champions. We connect talented creators with brands to build engaged communities and spark loyalty.\\n\\nPost-pandemic, people crave connection and shared joy. Using technology, we started using creators to weave companies and customers together into thriving communities.\\n\\nLooking ahead, we want Cult Creative to be the go-to platform for creators and brands in the region. Our mission is to empower creators with the right tools so brands can grow their audience and their business.\\n\\nWant to see what Cult Creative can do? Join us in shaping Malaysia's creator economy!\\n\\n#creatormarketing #creatoreconomy #ugccommunity #ugc #ugccreators #cultcreative"}, {"like": 98, "comment": 9, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0Lc40SDbpxIcFIeoy9FwaxO02OdXcGlCwYHNz%2FHUVcmbTB1bE4xu7A7poorumxPpBZ3gNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C1qdBulJwog/", "description": "WHAT A GREAT START TO 2024 🥳\\n\\nI’m thrilled to share an extraordinary and crucial milestone for @cultcreativeasia. We have successfully secured a significant investment from The Hive Southeast Asia to develop our creator collaboration platform! This milestone follows a strategic evolution and the unfortunate loss of co-founder @manisha_jm 🕊️\\n\\nRead more in the link on on our strategic pivot, the tech-enabled creator collaboration platform, and the future roadmap that positions Cult Creative at the forefront of innovation in the creator economy landscape 🌐\\n\\nWe’re not just changing the game; we’re defining it💥 \\n\\nThank you for being part of Cult Creative’s incredible journey. Stay tuned for more exciting updates!"}, {"like": 62, "comment": 0, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcSXn9zpFQ0mwQXqLw0PYbWRwoE1Q85OlnILcLx1ZPBap%2F8xbkZ5rOxZeFL%2FYL7pv0Xt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C4VfsCLJ_8Y/", "description": "Kyoto diaries ✨\\n#steadysakura"}, {"like": 102, "comment": 6, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcaPKLVjCfpI3dTA4%2BnlSHFtcBZElaFwPDOyS6JHRh9Idq7gJ2QazUM7oAPc%2F1CeY%2BgNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6nqzzTpaUz/", "description": "We’re just millennials, standing in front of an Instagram audience, asking them to watch 2 minutes instead of 15 seconds.\\n\\nBack story: we filmed this earlier this year when I came out of maternity and dug deeper into our business pivot. \\n\\nWe would do anything for @cultcreativeasia and the creator community, and we’re here to stay."}, {"like": 51, "comment": 0, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcWRN4%2FWaN8xmrhJRtQY39%2FP6abqzba8H5U4zzUboiZN76o8Ef8Z0YOEHM9X3eK0CvWwq5%2BhsabX0Nc9aXCBbcsw%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C7_NWfAp-Gb/", "description": "We celebrated Izran’s 39th birthday at @hotelindigokualalumpur 😍\\n\\n1. Rafa loved @thesilvermonkeykl space!\\n2. We ordered Father’s Day Specials featuring Meat & Match Platter (RM298) - Grilled Angus sirloin, spring chicken, artisanal sausage, honey corn and broccolini and Seafood Platter (RM260) - Grilled white squid, snapper fillet, king prawns, cherry tomatoes and broccolini — it was delicious! \\n4. The chef shares their Signature Salt Master Lutong, which is comprised of rock salt chilies, rock salt black cardamom, and rock salt lemongrass.\\n5. The chef invited Djibrel and Mika for an exclusive kitchen tour and taught the boys to make pasta.\\n6. A birthday cake surprise from the amazing Hotel Indigo team featuring the most delicious raspberry mousse cake.\\n\\nCan’t think of any place to celebrate Father’s Day? Look no further than @hotelindigokualalumpur @thesilvermonkeykl 🌿"}, {"like": 34, "comment": 0, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcJ%2FuOMnV9740jVHPzmRYgoL2xBP6yTLPvAfGxuoh5i1Sels%2BkJsW1hB7sPIJ1JA3rXt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9UBupUJFFz/", "description": "I loved my new @lenskartsg boss lewk so much, I got matching frames from their Kids Collection for my baby CEOs💧\\n\\n#lenskartsg"}, {"like": 71, "comment": 0, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0Lc%2FjqOB8ZMpLFPPFcHEQMjzygy8ZGlUO2W3zpSCJie3zzchfiIA4uNfjN2t8ujSgyRgNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-zSz05JaEs/", "description": "Beautiful Sunday in Bangkok to get some vitamin D 🌞"}, {"like": 111, "comment": 7, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcRa9NSYuEe59HeWIiFhSKO9QpFNkR%2FvHKFoYs87zDzLUFNo4d6D4TjhYPcdX%2BJc%2BNXt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": 