they won’t read this/it won’t be relevant!”. Then every time I look, it’s a Friday lol. Well here we are and sis has to hassle to hustle. It’s been a ride since CLEO 🎢🎡 I’ve since created my own website for my CV and portfolio to house some of the things that we worked on, and I’m now I’m super keen to work with like-minded writers on projects that have been coming in here and there since then. \\nThere’s a link in my bio for you to register your details with me and specify what sort of writing you’re good at/would like to do. \\nIf you’re a business/publication/PR that needs writing solutions you can also drop your details via the form there and I’ll try magic to match writers (or me lol) to your needs.\\n\\nTGIF xx"}, {"like": 360, "comment": 14, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDbLZrocPSR%2BHyuXnjq%2FEk8PJa%2F1IeAAtj%2BMS5I9X6lrxF5IqAlxh%2Bq4nkz3GrVg4p4CnA5or%2Fd%2F%2FcqMQkotCRP5gNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CvhTRrkL4vN/", "description": "ERM 004 : Presenting @leanbeans, who is in the business of opportunities, constantly strives to be better than yesterday. The co-founder of a career discovery and professional networking platform for South East Asian creatives, Lina is also a kickass supermama!"}, {"like": 342, "comment": 23, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDYElzQ8azFJzmu%2FFSX2Dbh4G%2FKSeXRSqrFJmfEwwE2bRiDu08c9QBlKsVviv7r2yRFYNGBspM8qY1gq1X%2FihKE7ZtdDww48a26Ju5Yf8aYzwg%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CT4V4GeptSo/", "description": "Happy ______ Day 💫"}, {"like": 331, "comment": 13, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDbqVd0DBQjnYdFrN7JJSLdmYekCT5gRyNOm2vxioHIv5165oQaUe9NTzCHjQWmgMVEN28kg1vHDMsACwAwH%2Fh6rWwq5%2BhsabX0Nc9aXCBbcsw%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/CXNvCT0p8RB/", "description": "There are only a few choice humans