@themaggywang for sneaking us up on stage last min ✨✨✨🙏🙏✨✨✨"}, {"like": 116, "comment": 10, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcesLMoDTgrHLcclcA%2BUTF0NGIfqPH%2FtjGNLZEhLx%2BBp1VLMHAX6lyTRUAgzxegi2SgNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C7-zW77JwaF/", "description": "Lesson #2: Get your husband’s shirt size right so you don’t ruin a surprise 😮‍💨 \\n\\nSo glad I could tap into Mohsin’s golf-dad ⛳️ core with @kualesa.apparel — honestly with the 30% Father’s Day discounts I should just buy more so I can enjoy looking at them🏌️‍♂️\\n\\nIf you’re stuck on gift ideas then check out their website and their Father’s Day promotion, ASAP! 🏃"}, {"like": 106, "comment": 2, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0Lc8Y30H%2Bocf68xK6EywIKgvi4V11VZiS%2BnJ7YllHkFACtcAnHGK%2F5NliiCCFKjwbZkWwq5%2BhsabX0Nc9aXCBbcsw%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C158X2PJu2S/", "description": "Mamas, you need to feel like YOU in order to show up as your best self for your kids. \\n\\nCarve out some time for just yourself, to emerge re-energised and renewed. \\nI did that with the 90-min Post-Natal massage at @mimone.spa which uses hot stones and an experienced senior therapist. I immediately felt relief with the hot stones and the deep, deep pressure she used which brought back my circulation and my energy.\\n\\nTry it! Mimone has spas in convenient locations near you.\\n\\n#postnatal #postnatalmassage #postpartum"}, {"like": 87, "comment": 4, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcRPmq4wsuFdocgMsBB6xXG5d7HFhSZvxQJUGZjXyMUT7GUcQc9NyuV2uFeBT4z%2FLGgNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9XSnMSIDAt/", "description": "Whatever you do, find balance 🧘‍♀️ \\n\\nA Friday a month I usually set aside time for a safe space to reset and unwind with my besties. Over coffee we talk about work, our families and the future 🚀\\n\\nIt re-energises me for the weekend and is the perfect reset.\\n\\nThis week we came to @flint.kl for this Friday Unwind — here’s some deets! \\n📍 Flint, The Curve (find them at The Street) \\n\\n- Burger 🍔 (not pictured) 8.5/10, so good! \\n- Laksa Johor 8.5/10 - delish😮‍💨\\n- Braised Beef noodles 7.5/10 - the beef and broth are just right\\n- Keropok lekor (not pictured) - unrated, I’m a basic floury-doughy lekor girl so their homemade version was too intense for my palate \\n- Pecan tart - 8/10, I loved it!\\n- Tiramisu - 7/10 the portion felt too large so I got overwhelmed\\n- Coffee - 7/10 good for girlies who love a fuller, darker bitter roast\\n\\nDo you have a sacred ritual that fills you up? Let me know 🤍✨"}, {"like": 110, "comment": 9, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcZHoyIXjA9rUde8FI66oU7nHrIlCi19rVV%2BFm8ZAG3nN09UCwUY6zHNlI6KbO961fXt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C9KBzKapfMo/", "description": "@cultworkspace is really changing the game for creators and brands.\\n\\nWe’ve secured over 100 local and international brand deals, paying out more than RM400,000 to 1500 creators in 2024 alone. Those numbers are only part of our story though.\\n\\nWhat sets us apart is how we turn customers into brand champions. We connect talented creators with brands to build engaged communities and spark loyalty.\\n\\nPost-pandemic, people crave connection and shared joy. Using technology, we started using creators to weave companies and customers together into thriving communities.\\n\\nLooking ahead, we want Cult Creative to be the go-to platform for creators and brands in the region. Our mission is to empower creators with the right tools so brands can grow their audience and their business.\\n\\nWant to see what Cult Creative can do? Join us in shaping Malaysia's creator economy!\\n\\n#creatormarketing #creatoreconomy #ugccommunity #ugc #ugccreators #cultcreative"}, {"like": 102, "comment": 6, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcaPKLVjCfpI3dTA4%2BnlSHFtcBZElaFwPDOyS6JHRh9Idq7gJ2QazUM7oAPc%2F1CeY%2BgNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6nqzzTpaUz/", "description": "We’re just millennials, standing in front of an Instagram audience, asking them to watch 2 minutes instead of 15 seconds.\\n\\nBack story: we filmed this earlier this year when I came out of maternity and dug deeper into our business pivot. \\n\\nWe would do anything for @cultcreativeasia and the creator community, and we’re here to stay."}, {"like": 81, "comment": 1, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0LcvdlLJ7GLUNa9YMI82Em1O7c7Q47Rb6%2FtLJufT%2BYiNnoyFe2vOPpg29DbrkSMl%2FQkXt%2FYzeksBPYLUknr5ild2A%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C-KSyS0JCOi/", "description": "Not naming names, but my old pair of glasses = 🚮\\n\\n@lenskartsg fuses affordability with great quality and style. \\n\\nThey have a kid’s range too if your kids need specs! You can do mummy-and-me matching styles like this 🫶"}, {"like": 53, "comment": 6, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL92uYofJiSjDn1%2F6peL1lBwv3s%2BUvShHERlDZYmZ4eGQ1lFBg%2BQ9O%2FU0Lcqy2wdABA%2Bx%2BEmXlpSOAL2rNAoS5rn%2Fyj3vp7y62C9yOKcmb%2Fk2Uqyo5mnLe9ZfjigNlJUwVYqIiahjW32e%2BqWA%3D%3D", "content_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DAIOpA-Jtdm/", "description": "When your girlie hype squad says it’s hot, it’s hot. Mohsin better recognise! 😤\\n\\nIn all seriousness I found @peekthisdress from @sherarazi and wanted to share my experience. No more stressing about where to buy dresses for your next event, just rent!"}, {"like": 72, "comment": 9, "image_url": "https://imgp.sptds.icu/v2?mb0KwpL9