cent_10_median_view_v2", "unverifiedFlags": ["isPublic", "isRepost"], "profileActorRunId": "eoQCTAELl6LFKHWi0", "profileActorDatasetId": null}	A family spot tucked away in the neighbourhood of Bangsar. 🐾🧸\n\nWith a cosy little play area for the kids, a pet-friendly space for your fur babies, and good food for everyone, Porch & Pantry Cafe is definitely a place you don’t want to miss! 🤎\n\nPlus, they have a mom community too! 🫶🏻 Follow @porchandpantrycafe for updates on their events with @mumsunitemy.\n\n📍Porch & Pantry Cafe\nBayu Angkasa, Bangsar, KL \nOpening Hours : 8:30AM - 5PM (Tues - Sun)\n\n#PorchAndPantryCafe #BrunchSpotKL #KLFoodie #KLHiddenGem\nStrawberry Velvet Crunch is BACK! 🍓✨\n\nLebih Creamy, Lebih Padu with that sweet strawberry dip and velvet crumbs for that extra crunch! 😍\n\nAnd don’t miss the limited-edition Nikmat Negaraku Family Box 🇲🇾 \n💝 40pcs churros + 5 FREE dips. Perfect to share, gift or bring to the office!\n\n✨ And you’ll get a Free Merdeka sticker too!\n\n#MrChurros #StrawberryVelvetCrunch #NikmatNegaraku #Foodie\nThai lunch under RM20 in Publika?! 👀\n\nBaan Thai Publika is now serving Set Lunch that comes with 1 main and 1 mini soup from RM15.90 and yes, that crispy golden-brown fried duck egg is the highlight! 🤤\n\nWho said eating authentic Thai food has to break the bank? ✨\n\n📍 Baan Thai\nPublika, Solaris Dutamas KL\nLunch Set Deal : 12PM–3PM\n\n#BaanThaiPublika #KLLunchSet #CrispyDuckEgg  #KLFoodie\nKlang Fam, this one’s for you! 😍\n\nRise N Rice has launched their Dinner Menu with Malaysian Classics & Noodles to even Sharing Plates! 😍  So it’s not just mixed rice now. 😉\n\nFreshly sourced seafood, generous portions with affordable price and a great option for a family dinner. Plus.. no pork, no lard! ✨\n\nAnd here’s the best part! From now till 30th Sept 2026, enjoy Rise N Rice’s Special Set for 3–4 pax at only RM99 (NP RM124)! 🤩\n\nTime to gather your loved ones and head over to Klang for a delicious, affordable dinner! 🤤\n\n📍Rise N Rice Kafe & Katering\nBandar Botanik, Klang\nOpening Hours : 7AM -10PM \nDinner Menu : 6PM - 10PM\n\n#RiseNRice #DinnerSet #FreshSeafood #CateringMY #KlangFoodie\nHave you tried Ayam Gepuk Artisan yet? 👀\n\nAyam Gepuk as low as RM9.99 with crispy chicken with refillable drinks, nasi & sambal! 🔥🍚\n\nWorth the hype not just the low price, but delicious sambal and their fried chicken is to die for! 🤤\n\n📍Ayam Gepuk Artisan, BTHO\nOpening Hours : 11AM - 10PM\n📍 Also at multiple other locations! \n\n#AyamGepuk #AyamGepukArtisan #AyamGepukCrispy #KLFoodie\nChicken in a cone, delivered to your doorstep! 👀\n\nNo plates, no fuss. When work gets too much, just order in! 😮‍💨 @clucknconemy’s boneless crispy fried chicken drenched in your favourite sauce and served conveniently in a cone. 🤤\n\nCraving for some? Get yours delivered now via GrabFood or foodpanda and don’t miss their crazy combo deals! 🛵💨\n\n#CluckNCone #HalalFoodie #KLFoodie #ChickenInACone\nThe ultimate Indian Buffet hack! 🔥\n\nWhy pay full price when you can get the SAME buffet for less? 👀\n\nBarbeque Nation Pavilion KL serves up to 100+ Indian dishes, from biryani and curries to hot snacks, desserts and every table comes with its own live grill! 🫪\n\nThe Sedap Buffet here starts from only RM49… but HERE’S THE REAL HACK 👇🏽\n\n📱 Book your slot through the @eatigo_my app and enjoy up to 50% OFF! 🤯🔥\n\nSame food. Same buffet. Same experience. Just a better price! 😍\n\n #Eatigo #BarbequeNation #IndianBuffet #KLFoodie\nOmakase, at your own pace. 🍣✨\n\nAt Sushi Yoshi Omakase, you can choose from 5 Omakase Set Menu from RM298 featuring chef’s selected nigiri sushi and seasonal dishes. ✨\n\nEvery course is served directly by the chef, who takes the time to explain each dish so articulately while preparing and serving your meal at a comfortable pace.\n\nEvery bite  here had that incredibly fresh, clean and sweet aftertaste. 🐟✨\n\nIf you’re looking for an Omakase experience that feels intimate, relaxing and truly lets you appreciate the ingredients, this is one experience you don’t want to miss.\n\n📍Sushi Yoshi Omakase\nLaLaport Bukit Bintang City Centre\n\n#SushiYoshi #Omakase #JapaneseFood #KLFoodie\nRelax while your kids play!🧸✨\n\nFound a cute little spot at Plaza Arkadia (@missmarble.my) where parents can enjoy good food & drinks while the little ones play safely within sight! 🥰\n\n✨ Spacious kids’ playground\n🍰 Nutricious Meals\n🎈 Space for kids’ parties & gatherings\n🎨 Perfect for workshops & activities\n\nAnd the best part is, you can choose to do a little workshop with your kid! 💕\n\nWould you pick cupcake decorating or slime DIY?🥰\n\n📍 Miss Marble Cafe\nPlaza Arkadia, Desa Parkcity KL\nOpening Hours : 10AM - 7PM (Closes 8PM Frid & Sat)\n\n#MissMarbleCafe #KidFriendlyCafe #CupcakeDecorating #PlayCafe #KLFoodie\nAuthentic Italian flavours? 😮‍💨✨\n\nThanks to @hungryhub_my, you can enjoy a delectable sharing set for 2 (4 dishes + 2 drinks) at Luretta D.O.P. Ristorante Pizzeria for ONLY RM129! 🤯✨ \n\nThe same spread would normally cost around RM164, so you’re definitely getting more value for your money here. 😮‍💨\n\nJust 4 easy steps! \n✔️ Download Hungry Hub app \n✔️ Pick your restaurant\n✔️ Book your Exclusive Deal & pay upfront \n✔️ Show up & enjoy \n\nZero hidden charges. 😉\n\n#HungryHubMY #LurettaDOP #OneUtama #ItalianFoodKL #KLFoodie
