instagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/793580738_18618782245028196_4707774088753571691_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=_XTDi1iw7SQQ7kNvwFATunF&_nc_oc=Adru7VGtZ1jpuMyKsU9KG9EOKRkdoPH-jq17FYenct6JZuE9I77Y6Z5w7sMrOhbwgRQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=h9KTVZSFGkRzA7MNhElK5g&_nc_ss=7aa8c&oh=00_AQNBkMbEtqsb1ynCeJafNyYr3J6uGbqUBQttrX3nrwEzbw&oe=6ACA3ADD", "usedInSample": true, "rejectedReason": null}], "engagementRate": 1.9, "formulaVersion": "instagram_recent_10_median_view_v2", "unverifiedFlags": ["isAd", "isPinned", "isRepost", "isSponsored"], "profileActorRunId": "sd_muw3bgwa1mvvkai714", "profileActorDatasetId": "sd_muw3bgwa1mvvkai714"}	Ninja Flip Air Fry Oven RM399?? Tefal pan RM42?! Senipis kulit bawang imanku tengok harga macam ni 😩\n\nTBM Warehouse Sale is back! Discount sampai 80% OFF! Macam macam on sale, air fryer, oven, vacuum, fridge.\n\nFrom 1 Oct - 4 Oct, 4 Hari je tau! Cepat before stock habis!\n\n📍TBM Warehouse, Subang Hi-Tech\n1 - 4 Oct 2026\n10am - 7pm\nHappy Hour at 3pm!\n\n#shoppingsale #makmakshopping #momlife #sahmlife\nBaru duduk nak buat kerja, gaduh pulak, lepas tu nak minum air, then nak kencing pulak. 🥲\n\nBy the end of the day, after working & taking care of my kids, I don’t really want to cook complicated meals..\n\nWe had Mamee Chef Curry Laksa for dinner, and it’s sooo good! So creamy, delicious & comforting, and it took me 5 mins je 😩✨ The best thing to end a tiring day of work.\n\n@mameenoodlesmy\n#MameeChef #KenikmatanSebenar\n#momlife #stayathomeworkmom #simpledinneridea\nHusband ada kat rumah la, mak mak baru ada can nak me time 🤪\n\nBut tak me time sangat sebab kena bawak bank bergerak, anything for KitKat Dark ice cream 😌\nKitKat Dark ice cream is collaborating with Visit Malaysia! \n\nWhich limited edition packaging is your fav? I sukaa the island one 😍 get yours now oki! \n\n@nestleicecream.my \n#momlife #mommetime #momhumor #KITKATDarkIceCream #motherhood\nHave you tried sandwiching Nutella between puff pastry and popping it into a waffle maker? Absolute game changer!\n\nSpent the weekend the best way: making breakfast, snacking, and enjoying a stroll in the park with Nutella. 💗\n\n@nutellasea\n#Nutella #NutellaBiscuits #NutellaBready #momlife #slowliving breakfastidea\nsorry anak, umi nak kulit cantik 😌\n\n#momlife #relatablemom #funnymom #parenting #makmaksangat\nSo so senang nak buat, guna 4 things only, and boleh buat banyak banyak! It’s such a great sensory activity for kids, boleh buat ocean theme 🫧✨ \n\nIngredients:\n- 700ml Water\n- 1tsp Guar Gum\n- Colouring\n- Slime Activator as much as needed\n\nFor Slime Activator:\n- 1tsp Borax\n- 200ml Warm Water\n\nAda link for products too!\nSave & try it 💗\n\n#momlife #motherhood #kidsactivityideas #toddleractivity #sensoryplayideas\nMacam tu lah ek, pastu repeat sampai bila bila.. 🫠\n\n#momlife #momjokes #lawakmakmak #motherhood #relatablemom\nIt’s not easy to teach kids to be emotionally intelligent.. but it’s been really helpful when I can read books to my kids to teach them 💕\n\nThe Nurts: Growing Strong Inside & Out Book, by The Nurts & SJMC covers a lot of topic including emotional intelligence, confidence, eating healthy & even dealing with cancer.\n\nIt helps parents to explore difficult topic like emotional regulation, dealing with illness in family & more thru storytelling 🤍\n\nUse my code ‘TNSABRINA10’ for 10% discount!\n\n@thenurts @subangjaya_medicalcentre @bookxcess\n\n#momlife #TheNurtsFam #TheNurts #TheNurtsTales #emotionalintelligence\nMakcik who? 😭 Laju laju cari skincare anti-aging\n\nSo cantikk packaging baru Safi Youth Gold Rania, the metallic design looks so classy ✨\n\nAnd the Whipped Foam Cleanser & Day Cream SPF50+ is now rich with\n🤍 Collagen Peptide\n🤍 Curcumin Complex\n🤍 Nano 24K Gold\n\nAnd if buy now, you can stand a chance to win Rantai Emas worth RM4,788! And first 1000 customer will get RM5 TNG Rebate! Promosi sampai 30/9/2026. So don’t miss your chance 💕\n\n@safimalaysia\n#SafiYouthGoldRania #HalalSkinCare #Cerah #Anjal #FYP\nmengaku cepat siapa tekan? 🤣\n\nIf I have the new Haier Horizon fridge, tak payah beli groceries for 2 weeks! Space banyak, macam macam boleh simpan. And the design & function to keep your fruits, meat & veges fresh ✨✨ \n\nAda challenges, demos, freebis & colouring activity for kids too! Come check it out! Jangan lupa to drop by over the weekend at\n\n📍LG2 Orange Concourse,\nSunway Pyramid\n📆 3-6 September 2026\n\n#HaierMY #MoreCreationMorePossibilities #Horizon #HorizonCollection #HaierRefrigerator @haier_malaysia
\.
