nyokong bersorak tak henti-henti,\\nBila lapar lepas perlawanan hebat,\\nOppa Mee Swiss Bear pilihan hati.\\n\\nTendang bola penuh bergaya,\\nJaringan cantik raih kemenangan,\\nOppa Mee Swiss Bear memang juara,\\nEnak dimakan di setiap hidangan.\\n\\n#GoalGempakChallenge #SwissBear #BRJAlamDamai\\n@swissbearmy", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Da-q86KJuMu/", "comments": 7, "publishedAt": "2026-07-19T15:21:55.000Z", "ratePercent": null}, {"likes": 75, "saves": null, "views": 908, "postId": "3924475534190745270", "shares": null, "caption": "Fueling the present, charging the future. ⚡\\n\\n#maxusatklims2026 #shootwithmaxus #maxusbestcontent2026 @weststarmaxusmy\\n\\n​Why compromise when you can have both? Maxus is completely rewriting the rules for modern driving. \\n\\nWhether you need the raw, unyielding torque of turbo-diesel or the smart, zero-emission efficiency of next-gen EV innovation, Maxus delivers it all with zero sacrifices.\\n\\n​From rugged workhorses to premium tech-loaded flagships, choose the power that moves you. 🛠️🔋\\n\\n​Which lineup are you choosing? Drop a comment below! 👇", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZ2ibShJpa2/", "comments": 48, "publishedAt": "2026-06-21T15:03:58.000Z", "ratePercent": null}, {"likes": 35, "saves": null, "views": 858, "postId": "3909200343675989909", "shares": null, "caption": "RM100 kecil bagi orang lain, tapi sangat besar maknanya buat seorang ketua keluarga. #SARACaraKita @saysdotcom\\n\\n​Sebagai seorang ayah, tiada apa yang lebih melegakan selain melihat keperluan dapur dan barang anak-anak sentiasa cukup. Ramai yang tak tahu, bantuan RM100 SARA ni sebenarnya bukan sekadar bantu untuk beli beras atau susu, tapi ia juga bagi ruang bernafas untuk aliran tunai keluarga.\\n\\n​Bila kos barangan asas dah lepas guna SARA, duit poket yang ada boleh disimpan terus untuk tabung kecemasan atau keperluan sekolah anak-anak. Satu bantuan, tapi impaknya berangkai.\\n\\n​⚠️ Perkara penting yang ingin saya kongsi ⚠️\\n\\n​✅️ Bijak Bajet : Utamakan barangan yang murah, mengenyangkan, dan betul-betul perlu. Elakkan jajan.\\n\\n​✅️ Teknologi Membantu : Guna Aplikasi MyKasih untuk scan kod bar dan semak baki sebelum bayar. Sangat praktikal dan tak pening kepala kat kaunter.\\n\\n​✅️ Strategi Ekstra : Manfaatkan pembelian dengan memilih produk yang ada peraduan. Sambil menyelam minum air! Mana tahu ada rezeki berganda untuk keluarga.\\n\\n​Terima kasih atas bantuan SARA yang sangat bermakna ini. Dari dapur yang berasap, membawa kepada senyuman anak-anak di rumah.\\n\\n​Pucuk paku si daun selasih,\\nTumbuh melata di tepi perigi,\\nBantuan SARA kami berterima kasih,\\nMeringankan beban rezeki dikongsi.", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZARQAwpG-V/", "comments": 12, "publishedAt": "2026-05-31T13:11:59.000Z", "ratePercent": null}, {"likes": 428, "saves": null, "views": 5015, "postId": "3877338601663088778", "shares": null, "caption": "Ini lah cerita kami,\\nCerita sepanjang Aidilfitri,\\nMood makan tanpa henti,\\nKerana tiada drama untuk dilayani.\\n\\nJika tiada rumah terbuka,\\nKami pergi menjamu di luar,\\nHLP Raven Enema ada bersama,\\nSupaya makanan dinikmati tanpa drama.\\n\\n@hlpravenenema #MakanONDramaOFF\\n\\n#HLPRavenEnema #KempenRaya \\n#MukbangChallenge #RayaContest", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DXPEupKCciK/", "comments": 93, "publishedAt": "2026-04-17T14:07:53.000Z", "ratePercent": null}, {"likes": 26, "saves": null, "views": 842, "postId": "3863495615305034532", "shares": null, "caption": "Lemang dibakar api menyala,\\nJuadah tradisi di pagi hari;\\nWarna Hijau warna tema, \\nInilah kisah Ya Raya kami.", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DWd5MrdiSsk/", "comments": 11, "publishedAt": "2026-03-29T11:46:46.000Z", "ratePercent": null}, {"likes": 12, "saves": null, "views": 444, "postId": "3853477981826184750", "shares": null, "caption": "Chasing neon dreams through the heart of Bangkok.\\n\\nThere is something so magical about the city lights at night. Zooming through the streets on a neon-lit Tuk-Tuk is an absolute core memory! Thanks to @ais.touristsim.thailand , I can share these vibrant moments instantly without missing a beat. The connection is as bright as these lights!\\n\\n#No1TripwithAIS #CaptureThailand #AIS5G #AISThailand", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DV6Tc7QifYu/", "comments": 5, "publishedAt": "2026-03-15T16:00:23.000Z", "ratePercent": null}, {"likes": 219, "saves": null, "views": 5721, "postId": "3841933987342898846", "shares": null, "caption": "[Hi! Minta support sikit. Terima Kasih]\\nKadang-kala, kita bukan sekadar mencari rumah, tapi kita mencari tempat di mana setiap sudutnya kita boleh berkumpul & mencipta memori indah bersama yang tersayang. Dengan semua kemudahan & akses yang ada, masa bersama yang tersayang juga terpelihara ❤️\\n\\n@anjabangi #CiptaMomentAnja #AnjaBangi #Avaland\\n#Bangi #BandarBaruBangiCommunity", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DVRSpsmEtae/", "comments": 23, "publishedAt": "2026-02-27T17:44:30.000Z", "ratePercent": null}]	[{"likes": 25, "saves": null, "views": 635, "postId": "3953498307533498779", "shares": null, "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbdpcOgpGmb/", "accepted": true, "comments": 0, "postType": "Video", "publishedAt": "2026-07-31T16:03:28.000Z", "usedInSample": true, "rejectedReason": null}, {"likes": 30, "saves": null, "views": 638, "postId": "3817176878579040566", "shares": null, "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DT5ViWUicE2/", "accepted": false, "comments": 3, "postType": "Video", "publishedAt": "2026-01-24T13:58:58.000Z", "usedInSample": false, "rejectedReason": "PINNED"}, {"likes": 28, "saves": null, "views": 390, "postId": "3981033867206621540", "shares": null, "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dc_eTW1pnlk/", "accepted": true, "comments": 9, "postType": "Video", "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T15:56:30.000Z", "usedInSample": true, "rejectedReason": null}, {"likes": 75, "saves": null, "views": 908, "postId": "3924475534190