ids, boleh buat ocean theme 🫧✨ \\n\\nIngredients:\\n- 700ml Water\\n- 1tsp Guar Gum\\n- Colouring\\n- Slime Activator as much as needed\\n\\nFor Slime Activator:\\n- 1tsp Borax\\n- 200ml Warm Water\\n\\nAda link for products too!\\nSave & try it 💗\\n\\n#momlife #motherhood #kidsactivityideas #toddleractivity #sensoryplayideas", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DddSLVET7em/", "comments": 13, "publishedAt": "2026-09-19T05:48:46.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/DddSLVET7em.jpg"}, {"likes": 3, "saves": null, "views": 1866, "postId": "DdTNySazUAe", "shares": null, "caption": "Macam tu lah ek, pastu repeat sampai bila bila.. 🫠\\n\\n#momlife #momjokes #lawakmakmak #motherhood #relatablemom", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdTNySazUAe/", "comments": 13, "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T07:53:25.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/DdTNySazUAe.jpg"}, {"likes": 3, "saves": null, "views": 1125, "postId": "DdDeRXlTJCX", "shares": null, "caption": "It’s not easy to teach kids to be emotionally intelligent.. but it’s been really helpful when I can read books to my kids to teach them 💕\\n\\nThe Nurts: Growing Strong Inside & Out Book, by The Nurts & SJMC covers a lot of topic including emotional intelligence, confidence, eating healthy & even dealing with cancer.\\n\\nIt helps parents to explore difficult topic like emotional regulation, dealing with illness in family & more thru storytelling 🤍\\n\\nUse my code ‘TNSABRINA10’ for 10% discount!\\n\\n@thenurts @subangjaya_medicalcentre @bookxcess\\n\\n#momlife #TheNurtsFam #TheNurts #TheNurtsTales #emotionalintelligence", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdDeRXlTJCX/", "comments": 19, "publishedAt": "2026-09-09T05:08:46.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/DdDeRXlTJCX.