bleCafe #KidFriendlyCafe #CupcakeDecorating #PlayCafe #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdWNyvdRwM3/", "comments": 22, "publishedAt": "2026-09-16T11:50:15.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3987435181618692919.jpg"}, {"likes": 277, "saves": null, "views": 22924, "postId": "3986687333868310853", "shares": null, "caption": "Authentic Italian flavours? 😮‍💨✨\\n\\nThanks to @hungryhub_my, you can enjoy a delectable sharing set for 2 (4 dishes + 2 drinks) at Luretta D.O.P. Ristorante Pizzeria for ONLY RM129! 🤯✨ \\n\\nThe same spread would normally cost around RM164, so you’re definitely getting more value for your money here. 😮‍💨\\n\\nJust 4 easy steps! \\n✔️ Download Hungry Hub app \\n✔️ Pick your restaurant\\n✔️ Book your Exclusive Deal & pay upfront \\n✔️ Show up & enjoy \\n\\nZero hidden charges. 😉\\n\\n#HungryHubMY #LurettaDOP #OneUtama #ItalianFoodKL #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdTjwH9xRFF/", "comments": 14, "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T11:04:17.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3986687333868310853.jpg"}]	[{"likes": 317, "saves": null, "views": 15846, "postId": "3991762434368420142", "shares": null, "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdllsjoRzku/", "accepted": true, "comments": 26, "postType": "Video", "publishedAt": "2026-09-22T11:11:33.000Z", "thumbnailUrl": "https://scontent-waw2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/819728275_18632506804030981_3338987967387057327_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=Mzk5MTc2MjQzNDM2ODQyMDE0MjE4NjMyNTA2Nzk4MDMwOTgx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTYuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=0LVHKLenE6EQ7kNvwG0WJd5&_nc_oc=AdrWxJTB29ra6BM74V-LlYvFi4y2vM6XKHkW_3Qtoh8A1TkGRVUENWCabRzALARRNLk&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-2.cdninstagr