 27654, "postId": "3993208318482236298", "shares": null, "caption": "Thai lunch under RM20 in Publika?! 👀\\n\\nBaan Thai Publika is now serving Set Lunch that comes with 1 main and 1 mini soup from RM15.90 and yes, that crispy golden-brown fried duck egg is the highlight! 🤤\\n\\nWho said eating authentic Thai food has to break the bank? ✨\\n\\n📍 Baan Thai\\nPublika, Solaris Dutamas KL\\nLunch Set Deal : 12PM–3PM\\n\\n#BaanThaiPublika #KLLunchSet #CrispyDuckEgg  #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddquc8JRMOK/", "comments": 17, "publishedAt": "2026-09-24T11:01:03.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3993208318482236298.jpg"}, {"likes": 568, "saves": null, "views": 30199, "postId": "3992487975954224478", "shares": null, "caption": "Klang Fam, this one’s for you! 😍\\n\\nRise N Rice has launched their Dinner Menu with Malaysian Classics & Noodles to even Sharing Plates! 😍  So it’s not just mixed rice now. 😉\\n\\nFreshly sourced seafood, generous portions with affordable price and a great option for a family dinner. Plus.. no pork, no lard! ✨\\n\\nAnd here’s the best part! From now till 30th Sept 2026, enjoy Rise N Rice’s Special Set for 3–4 pax at only RM99 (NP RM124)! 🤩\\n\\nTime to gather your loved ones and head over to Klang for a delicious, affordable dinner! 🤤\\n\\n📍Rise N Rice Kafe & Katering\\nBandar Botanik, Klang\\nOpening Hours : 7AM -10PM \\nDinner Menu : 6PM - 10PM\\n\\n#RiseNRice #DinnerSet #FreshSeafood #CateringMY #KlangFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdoKqk4xRVe/", "comments": 21, "publishedAt": "2026-09-23T11:10:04.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3992487975954224478.jpg"}, {"likes": 317, "saves": null, "views": 15846, "postId": "3991762434368420142", "shares": null, "caption": "Have you tried Ayam Gepuk Artisan yet? 👀\\n\\nAyam Gepuk as low as RM9.99 with crispy chicken with refillable drinks, nasi & sambal! 🔥🍚\\n\\nWorth the hype not just the low price, but delicious sambal and their fried chicken is to die for! 🤤\\n\\n📍Ayam Gepuk Artisan, BTHO\\nOpening Hours : 11AM - 10PM\\n📍 Also at multiple other locations! \\n\\n#AyamGepuk #AyamGepukArtisan #AyamGepukCrispy #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdllsjoRzku/", "comments": 26, "publishedAt": "2026-09-22T11:11:33.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3991762434368420142.jpg"}, {"likes": 450, "saves": null, "views": 30501, "postId": "3991035214482033904", "shares": null, "caption": "Chicken in a cone, delivered to your doorstep! 👀\\n\\nNo plates, no fuss. When work gets too much, just order in! 😮‍💨 @clucknconemy’s boneless crispy fried chicken drenched in your favourite sauce and served conveniently in a cone. 🤤\\n\\nCraving for some? Get yours delivered now via GrabFood or foodpanda and don’t miss their crazy combo deals! 🛵💨\\n\\n#CluckNCone #HalalFoodie #KLFoodie #ChickenInACone", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdjAWHVRszw/", "comments": 12, "publishedAt": "2026-09-21T11:03:14.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3991035214482033904.jpg"}, {"likes": 609, "saves": null, "views": 41830, "postId": "3988893516373146210", "shares": null, "caption": "The ultimate Indian Buffet hack! 🔥\\n\\nWhy pay full price when you can get the SAME buffet for less? 👀\\n\\nBarbeque Nation Pavilion KL serves up to 100+ Indian dishes, from biryani and curries to hot snacks, desserts and every table comes with its own live grill! 🫪\\n\\nThe Sedap Buffet here starts from only RM49… but HERE’S THE REAL HACK 👇🏽\\n\\n📱 Book your slot through the @eatigo_my app and enjoy up to 50% OFF! 🤯🔥\\n\\nSame food. Same buffet. Same experience. Just a better price! 😍\\n\\n #Eatigo #BarbequeNation #IndianBuffet #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdbZYTiR7pi/", "comments": 20, "publishedAt": "2026-09-18T12:07:33.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3988893516373146210.jpg"}, {"likes": 690, "saves": null, "views": 54093, "postId": "3988149388097966269", "shares": null, "caption": "Omakase, at your own pace. 🍣✨\\n\\nAt Sushi Yoshi Omakase, you can choose from 5 Omakase Set Menu from RM298 featuring chef’s selected nigiri sushi and seasonal dishes. ✨\\n\\nEvery course is served directly by the chef, who takes the time to explain each dish so articulately while preparing and serving your meal at a comfortable pace.\\n\\nEvery bite  here had that incredibly fresh, clean and sweet aftertaste. 🐟✨\\n\\nIf you’re looking for an Omakase experience that feels intimate, relaxing and truly lets you appreciate the ingredients, this is one experience you don’t want to miss.\\n\\n📍Sushi Yoshi Omakase\\nLaLaport Bukit Bintang City Centre\\n\\n#SushiYoshi #Omakase #JapaneseFood #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdYwL0ExVC9/", "comments": 10, "publishedAt": "2026-09-17T11:29:09.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3988149388097966269.jpg"}, {"likes": 412, "saves": null, "views": 26620, "postId": "3987435181618692919", "shares": null, "caption": "Relax while your kids play!🧸✨\\n\\nFound a cute little spot at Plaza Arkadia (@missmarble.my) where parents can enjoy good food & drinks while the little ones play safely within sight! 🥰\\n\\n✨ Spacious kids’ playground\\n🍰 Nutricious Meals\\n🎈 Space for kids’ parties & gatherings\\n🎨 Perfect for workshops & activities\\n\\nAnd the best part is, you can choose to do a little workshop with your kid! 💕\\n\\nWould you pick cupcake decorating or slime DIY?🥰\\n\\n📍 Miss Marble Cafe\\nPlaza Arkadia, Desa Parkcity KL\\nOpening Hours : 10AM - 7PM (Closes 8PM Frid & Sat)\\n\\n#MissMarbleCafe #KidFriendlyCafe #CupcakeDecorating #PlayCafe #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdWNyvdRwM3/", "comments": 22, "publishedAt": "2026-09-16T11:50:15.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3987435181618692919.jpg"}, {"likes": 277, "saves": null, "views": 22924, "postId": "3986687333868310853", "shares": null, "caption": "Authentic Italian flavours? 😮‍💨✨\\n\\nThanks to @hungryhub_my, you can enjoy a delectable sharing set for 2 (4 dishes + 2 drinks) at Luretta D.O.P. Ristorante Pizzeria for ONLY RM129! 🤯✨ \\n\\nThe same spread would normally cost around RM164, so you’re definitely getting more value for your money here. 😮‍💨\\n\\nJust 4 easy steps! \\n✔️ Download Hungry Hub app \\n✔️ Pick your restaurant\\n✔️ Book your Exclusive Deal & pay upfront \\n✔️ Show up & enjoy \\n\\nZero hidden charges. 😉\\n\\n#HungryHubMY #LurettaDOP #OneUtama #ItalianFoodKL #KLFoodie", "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdTjwH9xRFF/", "comments": 14, "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T11:04:17.000Z", "ratePercent": null, "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/cult-prod/discovery-thumbnails/instagram/3986687333868310853.jpg"}]	[{"likes": 438, "saves": null, "views": 47141, "postId": "3996124460557512046", "shares": null, "postUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd1FgZFx61u/", "accepted": true, "comments": 16, "postType": "Video", "publishedAt": "2026-09-28T11:33:56.000Z", "thumbnailUrl": "https://instagram.fyxd3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/828480572_18634612075030981_7687627498295195803_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzk5NjEyNDQ2MDU1NzUxMjA0NjE4NjM0NjEyMDcyMDMwOTgx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTYuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=1zVhP1VdJH0Q7kNvwGaIfOm&_nc_oc=Adp5ItIFgKpDBvieWX35Gq-XGh0j7rOdMEaildqujL2ETIYpTbUMRNnzG-GHEc7rjKW1j-4_s5VeFdvZ8dBohqf9&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instag