cmnfpt11n006tpg01e4vkmpdw	\N	📍 @apricotbypeachesandcream @mytownkl 🌟 SAVE this spot for your brunch / dinner hangout! This newly opened European inspired cafe in MyTOWN Shopping Centre offers stunning brunch fare and is famous for their cakes with custard! Not to mention, the cafe also offers gluten free and vegan options in certain menu items. 🌱 The space is decorated in soft peach and pink hues, as well as apricot paintings to highlight the dreamy atmosphere. Ordered: Falafel Greek Salad 🧆⭐ (RM35) A unique, crisp, and flavourful salad that's not commonly found in eateries. Served with a side of balsamic vinegar, but it's also tasty on its own! 👍 Mushroom & Black Truffle Pizza 🍄‍🟫⭐ (Mini Size - RM19) It gave a distinctive profile from the mushrooms, making this a go-to pizza for mushroom fans. The pizza itself was airy and toasty too! Lamb Kofte & Spinach Pizza 🐐⭐ (RM37) White pizza with fior di latte (fresh cow's milk mozzarella), olives, and garlic chips. The spices from the lamb kofte really lifted the flavours, while the spinach and olives provided an extra satisfying balance. Fish & Chips 🐟⭐ (RM35) Hands down the best dish! Fish was beautifully fried; there's no fishiness involved. Together with the mushy peas and seasoned fries, they complemented each other perfectly 😋 Carbonara Beef Bacon Linguine 🍝 (RM38) It has a rich taste from the egg yolk cream sauce and crispy beef bacon slices; however, texture was leaning slightly on the dry side. Pasta was firm hence it's still enjoyable! Buttermilk Pancakes 🥞⭐ (RM28) 3 stacks of blueberry studded pancakes accompanied by caramelised bananas, strawberries, pecans, homemade strawberry jam, and honey. These pancakes not only looked gorgeous, but were also chewy, dense, and moderately sweet! 🫶 Hummingbird Cake 🍌⭐ (RM19) Banana and pineapple moist cake topped with pumpkin seeds and cream; the cake was soft and aromatic. Surprisingly, the custard wasn't overpowering and its sweetness was just right ✨ would recommend getting this! Peaches & Cream Cheesecake 🍑 (RM24) New York cheesecake with peach bits and cream, using a ginger cookie base. It even has peaches inside too! Texture is creamy yet light, but the peaches could be more pronounced. Berry Lassi 🫐⭐ (RM18) Liked this a lot as there's no additional sugars included - pure and simply fruity! 🤩 Apple Cucumber Mint Juice 🧃 (RM16) Though the apple and cucumber in the juice were distinctive, it could be enhanced by adding more mint. Matcha Frappe 🥛 (RM19) Texture is more of a liquid rather than ice blended, and the matcha was very faint - like a milk/cream based drink. However, we managed to taste the apricot jam at the end; the beverage presentation could be better. 🚆 Nearest public transportation: Cochrane MRT Station 🏠 Lot G-019 & G-E-019, MyTOWN Shopping Centre, Maluri, 55100 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur	cmndz9hnm000rmy01767zhomv	CHANGES_REQUIRED	2026-04-01 07:19:01.26	2026-04-05 16:47:22.103	2026-04-05 16:44:16	\N	cmeqlonw80000p6011bcdxgfp	cm_video_type_2025	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	1	v4	\N	\N	\N
